                                        <h3>How much does HRMS cost?</h3>
                                        <p>Off-shelf SMB: ₹100-400/employee/month. Enterprise: ₹800-3,500/employee/month. Custom builds: ₹35 lakh - 1.8 Cr.</p>
                                        <h3>Should I build custom HRMS or use Darwinbox / Zoho?</h3>
